# Solusi PDA (pdakotty)

Read `AGENTS.md` at repo root for architecture, API map, and file layout.

Quick facts:
- Cordova Android PDA app; source lives in `www/` (static HTML + jQuery)
- Backend: POST FormData to `https://store.kottykosmetik.com/Q_*` controllers
- Auth: `localStorage` keys `tokenpda`, `toko`, `id`, `user`, `first`, `last`
- Barcode: `openBarcodeScanner()` from `www/scripts/barcode-scanner.js`
- Toasts: `showNotification(msg, type)` in `www/scripts/custom.js`
- UI: Bootstrap + Azures template; custom styles in `www/styles/modern-ui.css`

When editing:
- Match per-page inline script style (no modules/bundler)
- Keep Indonesian UI strings
- Minimize scope — do not refactor duplicated auth/ajax unless asked
- New HTML pages: update `www/_service-worker.js` STATIC_ASSETS
- Do not edit `www/fonts/`, `platforms/`, or Cordova `plugins/`
